cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "The AI Prose Clock: Detection-Free Measurement of LLM-Style Writing Diffusion, 2019-2026"
abstract: >-
  A corpus-internal, detection-free estimator of the diffusion of LLM-style
  prose. For every word we fit a pre-ChatGPT log-rate trend with seasonality,
  extrapolate a counterfactual, and measure post-2022 excess vocabulary across
  independent corpora; a logistic diffusion curve converts the index into
  dated milestones.
authors:
